nto the most pressing challenges - climate change, education, gender, urban development, international trade, public health, and more. Also available are on-demand resources, expert talks, data visualization, and other online courses through the Open Learning Campus (OLC) Platform.\n \nWhether you are a policymaker, development practitioner, or are curious to learn more, the WBG-OLC VR app is a place to virtually experience real-world challenges.", "short_description": "WBG-OLC's immersive learning powers storytelling through bite-sized 360 stories, virtual tours, and visualizations and takes you inside the world of some of the most crucial challenges of global development.\n\nExperience next-generation interactive learning by getting a peek into the most pressing challenges - climate change, education, gender, urban development, international trade, public health, and more."}]}, "developer_name": "Visyon360", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.worldbank.org/en/about/legal/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "World Bank Group VR", "support_website_url": "https://olc.worldbank.org/", "website_url": "https://olc.worldbank.org/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "MEDIA_PLAYER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "347185933728807"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566678_331646867966915_6888911273845246345_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&cc